  abilityId: 1830838
  abilityName: Artistic Anarchy
  abilityDesc: 25 combo Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    spark damage fills BB gauge for 3 turns, adds Earth shield for 3 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def relative to Rec for 3 turns, restores HP for 3 turns & fills OD gauge
    at turn's end for 3 turns
